{"title":"Build a Set of Unique Fruits","lesson":"L1 · Sets and Dictionaries · Set basics","desc":"Create a set of fruit names using curly braces. Include a duplicate fruit and observe that a set keeps only one copy of each value.","startFile":"python","goals":[{"id":"creates-set","label":"Creates a set with curly braces","target":"python","kind":"regex","rule":"\b\w+\s*=\s*\{\s*["']","flags":"i","minCount":1},{"id":"prints-set-result","label":"Prints the set result","target":"python","kind":"regex","rule":"print\s*\(","flags":"i","minCount":1}],"targetHtml":"<pre><code>Unique fruits: ['apple', 'banana', 'orange']
