{"title":"Character Frequency Counter","lesson":"L1 · Sets and Dictionaries · Iterating over dictionaries","desc":"Create a dictionary named counts that records how many times each character appears in the exact string "banana bandana". Include the space as a character, then iterate over the dictionary with items() and print each character and its frequency.","startFile":"python","goals":[{"id":"creates-counts-dictionary","label":"Creates an empty counts dictionary","target":"python","kind":"regex","rule":"counts\s*=\s*\{","flags":"i","minCount":1},{"id":"loops-through-text","label":"Loops through every character","target":"python","kind":"regex","rule":"for\s+\w+\s+in\s+text\s*:","flags":"i","minCount":1},{"id":"updates-frequency","label":"Updates a frequency for each character","target":"python","kind":"regex","rule":"counts\s*\[.*?\]\s*=","flags":"i","minCount":1},{"id":"iterates-over-dictionary","label":"Iterates over dictionary items","target":"python","kind":"regex","rule":"counts\.items\s*\(","flags":"i","minCount":1}],"targetHtml":"<pre><code>'b': 2
