{"title":"Snack Stand Receipt with Functions","lesson":"L1 · Problem Solving 3 · Function-based problem solving","desc":"Refactor a snack stand checkout into reusable functions. Create functions to calculate each item total, calculate the full order total, and print a receipt.","startFile":"python","goals":[{"id":"item-total-function","label":"Defines an item total function","target":"python","kind":"regex","rule":"def\s+calculate_item_total\s*\(","flags":"i","minCount":1},{"id":"order-total-function","label":"Defines an order total function","target":"python","kind":"regex","rule":"def\s+calculate_order_total\s*\(","flags":"i","minCount":1},{"id":"receipt-function","label":"Defines a receipt function","target":"python","kind":"regex","rule":"def\s+print_receipt\s*\(","flags":"i","minCount":1},{"id":"uses-helper","label":"Uses a reusable helper function","target":"python","kind":"regex","rule":"calculate_item_total\s*\(","flags":"i","minCount":2}],"targetHtml":"<pre><code>Snack Stand Receipt
