{"title":"Reserve Seats Safely","lesson":"L1 · Errors and exceptions · Custom exceptions","desc":"Create a custom <code>NotEnoughSeatsError</code> exception for a seat reservation system. Raise it when someone requests more seats than are available, then catch it and print a helpful message.","startFile":"python","goals":[{"id":"defines-custom-exception","label":"Defines a custom exception","target":"python","kind":"regex","rule":"class\s+NotEnoughSeatsError\s*\(\s*Exception\s*\)","flags":"i","minCount":1},{"id":"raises-custom-exception","label":"Raises the custom exception","target":"python","kind":"regex","rule":"raise\s+NotEnoughSeatsError","flags":"i","minCount":1},{"id":"catches-custom-exception","label":"Catches the custom exception","target":"python","kind":"regex","rule":"except\s+NotEnoughSeatsError","flags":"i","minCount":1}],"targetHtml":"<pre><code>Reservation failed: only 2 seat(s) are available.</code></pre>","targetSub":"A custom exception explains why the reservation cannot be completed.","files":{"guide":{"html":"","css":"","js":"","python":"class NotEnoughSeatsError(Exception):
    """Raised when a reservation asks for too many seats."""
    pass


def reserve_seats(available, requested):
    if requested > available:
        raise NotEnoughSeatsError(
            f"only {available} seat(s) are available."
        )
    return available - requested


try:
    seats_left = reserve_seats(2, 3)
    print(f"Reservation successful. {seats_left} seat(s) left.")
except NotEnoughSeatsError as error:
    print("Reservation failed:", error)"},"pair":{"html":"","css":"","js":"","python":"class NotEnoughSeatsError(Exception):
    """Raised when a reservation asks for too many seats."""
    pass


def reserve_seats(available, requested):
    if requested &gt; available:
        raise NotEnoughSeatsError(
            f"only {available} seat(s) are available."
        )
    return available - requested


# 👈 YOUR CODE: call reserve_seats(2, 3) inside try/except and print the error"},"solo":{"html":"","css":"","js":"","python":""}},"solution":{"html":"","css":"","js":"","python":"class NotEnoughSeatsError(Exception):
