{"title":"Build a Dog with Inheritance","lesson":"L1 · Object-Oriented Programming 2 · Inheritance Basics","desc":"Create a parent <code>Animal</code> class and a child <code>Dog</code> class. Use <code>super().__init__()</code> inside <code>Dog</code> so the parent class sets the dog's name, then add the dog's breed in the child class.","startFile":"python","goals":[{"id":"has-parent-class","label":"Creates the Animal parent class","target":"python","kind":"regex","rule":"class\s+Animal","flags":"i","minCount":1},{"id":"has-child-inheritance","label":"Creates Dog as an Animal child class","target":"python","kind":"regex","rule":"class\s+Dog\s*\(\s*Animal\s*\)","flags":"i","minCount":1},{"id":"calls-parent-init","label":"Uses super() to call the parent initializer","target":"python","kind":"regex","rule":"super\s*\(\s*\)\s*\.\s*__init__\s*\(","flags":"i","minCount":1}],"targetHtml":"<pre><code>Name: Luna
